source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(out.stdout).expect(\"stdout should be UTF-8\")"
---
Show calendar events

Usage: nib cal [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list       List events (the default) [alias: ls]
  calendars  List and manage calendars
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json             Print JSON instead of text
  -w, --week             Show the next seven days instead of today
      --calendar <NAME>  Only show events from this calendar
      --show-calendar    Show each event's calendar
      --details          Show each event's location, meeting link, and notes
  -h, --help             Print help
